      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why we need define two parcelables for subgroup: LeAudioBroadcastSubgroupConfiguration and LeAudioSubgroupBisConfiguration?\n\n\nIf we define the LeAudioBroadcastSubgroupConfiguration like below, then LeAudioSubgroupBisConfiguration seems not be required.\n\n\n parcelable LeAudioBroadcastSubgroupConfiguration {\n        int numBis;\n        List\u003cLeAudioBisConfiguration\u003e bisConfigurations;\n }",
