      "writtenOn": "2023-11-08T13:23:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The comments do not explain it properly. I\u0027ll fix that.\n\nAnyway, the explaination is as follows:\nEach Subgroup (`LeAudioBroadcastSubgroupConfiguration`) has a list of distinct configurations for the number of BISes (`List\u003cLeAudioSubgroupBisConfiguration\u003e bisConfigurations`), where each configuration (`LeAudioBisConfiguration bisConfiguration`) can be applied to `int numBis` number of BISes. `numBis` is there to not duplicate the same configuration when more than one BIS has the same configuration, and it the reason for this additional structure nesting.\n\nWith your proposal I\u0027m not sure how multiple configurations `List\u003cLeAudioBisConfiguration\u003e bisConfigurations` are applied to `int numBis` number of BISes.",
      "parentUuid": "1fd0748d_6fe7c374",
      "revId": "00c9684cef0ebc10a6f0a4424d91559c42308d7f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
